# Never commit anyone's job search data.
#
# The extension list below is not enough on its own: a real working folder
# turned out to hold rate assessments, take-home briefs and reply drafts as
# plain .md, all of them naming real employers, and 'git add -A' would have
# swept every one of them in. Ignore the working directories by name as well.
job-search/
Claude outputs/
scans/
applications/
*.pdf
*.docx
*.pptx
*.xlsx
*.csv
!templates/*.docx
.DS_Store
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
